          {
            "title": "Example: No value",
            "id": 74294,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Вызови функцию <code>doubleNumber()</code> и передай значение <code>5</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"doubleNumber\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = number * \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"doubleNumber(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"84\" endIndex=\"96\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"98\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"10\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>doubleNumber</code>, а затем <code>5</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Вызови функцию со значением, при котором консоль отобразит <code>10</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"doubleNumber\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = number * \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"doubleNumber(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"84\" endIndex=\"96\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"98\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"result\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"10\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"displayHalf\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"10\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>doubleNumber</code>, а затем <code>5</code>.</p></body></html>",
